# octahedron with smooth vertex normals
# normals point radially outward, so phong interpolation makes 8 flat faces look like a sphere

v  0.0  1.5  0.0
v  1.5  0.0  0.0
v  0.0  0.0 -1.5
v -1.5  0.0  0.0
v  0.0  0.0  1.5
v  0.0 -1.5  0.0

vn  0.0  1.0  0.0
vn  1.0  0.0  0.0
vn  0.0  0.0 -1.0
vn -1.0  0.0  0.0
vn  0.0  0.0  1.0
vn  0.0 -1.0  0.0

f 1//1 2//2 3//3
f 1//1 3//3 4//4
f 1//1 4//4 5//5
f 1//1 5//5 2//2
f 6//6 3//3 2//2
f 6//6 4//4 3//3
f 6//6 5//5 4//4
f 6//6 2//2 5//5
